{
  "info": {
    "name": "Butterbear Campground Booking",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Run npm install, copy .env.example to .env and set MONGO_URI and a random JWT_SECRET, then npm run seed and npm start.\n\nSet ADMIN_EMAIL and ADMIN_PASSWORD locally before seeding to create an admin. These credentials are never included in this collection.\n\nRun User workflow first. The pre-request script generates an isolated test email, tomorrow check-in and a 3-night stay.\n\nEthereal is a test inbox and does not deliver to a real mailbox. GET booking notifications returns preview URLs once the worker processes jobs.\n\nReminders run at 09:00 on the day before check-in in the campground timezone. A late booking queues the reminder immediately while check-in is still in the future. Check-in is at 14:00.\n\nWeather uses Open-Meteo. The API supports dates within its 16-day forecast range. The reminder still sends with an unavailable-weather note if the provider is down.\n\nRun the Admin examples individually after setting ADMIN_EMAIL and ADMIN_PASSWORD in Postman. They operate on the test booking ID and demo campground ID.\n\nEmail jobs are stored with the booking, retried up to five attempts and delivered at least once. A crash after SMTP acceptance can cause a duplicate.\n\nFor actual email delivery set MAIL_TRANSPORT=smtp, SMTP_HOST, SMTP_PORT, SMTP_USER, SMTP_PASSWORD and an authorized MAIL_FROM. Production requires SMTP."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{TOKEN}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:5005",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "EMAIL",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "PASSWORD",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "TOKEN",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "CAMPGROUND_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "BOOKING_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "CHECK_IN",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "CHECK_OUT",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ADMIN_EMAIL",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ADMIN_PASSWORD",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "User workflow",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get(\"EMAIL\")) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"EMAIL\", \"butterbear-\" + Date.now() + \"@example.test\");",
              "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get(\"PASSWORD\")) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"PASSWORD\", pm.variables.replaceIn(\"{{$guid}}\"));",
              "const dateIn = new Date(Date.now() + 86400000).toLocaleDateString(\"en-CA\", { timeZone: \"Asia/Bangkok\" });",
              "const dateOut = new Date(Date.now() + 4 * 86400000).toLocaleDateString(\"en-CA\", { timeZone: \"Asia/Bangkok\" });",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"CHECK_IN\", dateIn); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"CHECK_OUT\", dateOut);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{URL}}/api/v1/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Butterbear Test User\",\n  \"phone\": \"0800000000\",\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{PASSWORD}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "if (pm.response.code < 300) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"TOKEN\", pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{URL}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{PASSWORD}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
